{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/2ef9ccd04677544b19a2fd6a55db7a72.poster.avif?t=1770721017\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/2ef9ccd04677544b19a2fd6a55db7a72.webm?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/2ef9ccd04677544b19a2fd6a55db7a72.mp4?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joltt \u2013 Battle Pillars is a 2D fighting game where every character is a zoner. Victory isn\u2019t about depleting your opponent\u2019s health, but making them fall from their pillar. Outmaneuver their attacks and knock them off with your projectiles to be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/85a4fecbef76cc1708e16d11c58578ea.poster.avif?t=1770721017\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/85a4fecbef76cc1708e16d11c58578ea.webm?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/85a4fecbef76cc1708e16d11c58578ea.mp4?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no blocking in Joltt.\u00a0Read your opponent\u2019s mind, dodge, evade and counter everything to be victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/db398e7f6f3950528ab204ca07598d4a.avif?t=1770721017\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Ranked &amp; Casual Match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local VS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode (do whatever you can to survive a huge wave of incoming projectiles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/d73d4f680ce2902e9df34c895a851430.poster.avif?t=1770721017\" width=634 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/d73d4f680ce2902e9df34c895a851430.webm?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/d73d4f680ce2902e9df34c895a851430.mp4?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/7a5fa1259467ae796a1e4174924dce2e.webp?t=1770721017\" width=1200 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/2ef9ccd04677544b19a2fd6a55db7a72.poster.avif?t=1770721017\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/2ef9ccd04677544b19a2fd6a55db7a72.webm?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/2ef9ccd04677544b19a2fd6a55db7a72.mp4?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and master 6 different wizards, each having a vastly different gameplay!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ell uses powerful feints and casts multiple projectiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okhpum has to summon spirits to gain access to his most powerful moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xioko uses the power of the wind and can fly freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myra has access to different modes by igniting her sword with colored flames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Braboz summons unpredictable portals and can teleport around the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alsnad has great control over the speed of his projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first one to fill up your super bar and unleash your devastating super move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No complicated inputs.  All powers are cast with a simple button press, sometimes associated with a direction. You\u2019ll go straight into the mind games without passing hours in the training room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.poster.avif?t=1770721017\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.webm?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.mp4?t=1770721017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Who made that thing!?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/c9f49d3cd32c6b2313f00c14fad043b2b5c98c0d.jpg"},{"name":"Tell me a story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/06e97bf42defdcd7fe5c653bd97a067a8c6fa9f3.jpg"},{"name":"Story master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/928d4c23410514f703dcf6d8e5e19c544c45c809.jpg"},{"name":"Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/6d5e78e52ea53941cceb9b3e7b5e03b70bdfa119.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/e6c6f1539fc236b81115d510770e3850b02b1171.jpg"},{"name":"Challenge Mastery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/c47bd0832a7d2f8f4e13d81a31cc1ecae6b94f02.jpg"},{"name":"Learn the basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/928d4c23410514f703dcf6d8e5e19c544c45c809.jpg"},{"name":"New friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/371598909d269f0cc611fcc45073fbb4a71b0f98.jpg"},{"name":"More friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/e978d2f013d017adbd2a5214f898ce4272161af7.jpg"},{"name":"Into the lab","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3353130/b45f6a5a37e3d07e8c147c4c50d5ba72139c5f55.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3353130?t=1770721017","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770721017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/81eec6cd21ae